  "basis": [
    "Revenue: a fee of 1.4% of each financing originated through Mizan, paid by the lender (EGP 14,000 for each EGP 1 million originated), plus a one-off set-up fee of EGP 250,000 when a partner launches a new product. Partners settle each month's fees in the following month.",
    "Financings sit on the partner banks' balance sheets, not Mizan's; Mizan carries no credit risk. Non-performing rates are as reported by the partner banks."
  ],
